Name: ypldap
Description: YP map server using LDAP backend
URL: https://man.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=ypldap&manpath=FreeBSD+15.0-RELEASE
Version: 15.0
License: NOASSERTION
Source: https://cgit.freebsd.org/src/tree/usr.sbin/ypldap?h=stable/15
